  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Family-based Agricultural Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers in Colombia&apos;s traditional coffee region are struggling due to the global fall in coffee prices. The Asociacin de Productores Indgenas y Campesinos de Riosucio Caldas (Asproinca) improves the members&apos; livelihoods of its members by improving coffee production, and promoting agricultural diversification and small-enterprise development. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Colombia. Asproinca&apos;s activities promote smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s broader initiative to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
